<title>UK: BA/American extend frequent flyer.</title>
<headline>BA/American extend frequent flyer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said on Wednesday it had agreed to extend its frequent flyer programme relationship with AMR Corp's American Airlines.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that British Airways Executive Club members and American Airlines Advantage members could &quot;earn and burn&quot; air miles on each other's networks.</p>
<p>They can also earn points towards tier status of their respective frequent flyer scheme.</p>
